WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:02.858
- I think the problem is
we don't die quick enough.

00:00:02.858 --> 00:00:04.620
(audience laughs)

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.627
Somebody said to me the other day,

00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:07.530
"You know, in 40 years, you'll be 79."

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.363
And I thought,

00:00:08.363 --> 00:00:09.897
"How long is this going to go on for?"

00:00:09.897 --> 00:00:13.140
(audience laughs)

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.370
We just keep living,

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.340
so you have to keep coming
up with things to do.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.240
And that's why you're here,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.936
so you've done something tonight.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:22.200
(audience laughs)

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.033
'Cause tomorrow, people will say,

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.120
"What did you do last night?"

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.088
And you can say,

00:00:25.088 --> 00:00:25.921
"I went to this comedy show,

00:00:25.921 --> 00:00:28.020
because I live in London,
I'm alive, I'm alive."

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.150
(audience laughs)

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.183
Are you though?

00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:33.510
(audience laughs)

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.180
Or are you just desperately
filling the time

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.953
so you don't have to feel any pain.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:40.610
(audience laughs)

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:42.208
Well you came to the wrong show.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.426
(audience laughs)

00:00:44.426 --> 00:00:47.509
(gentle piano music)

